TI  - Prebunking messaging to inoculate against COVID-19 vaccine misinformation: an effective strategy for public health
AU  - Vivion, M
AU  - Sidi, EAL
AU  - Betsch, C
AU  - Dionne, M
AU  - Dubé, E
AU  - Driedger, SM
