AB  - Due to their exponential growth, social media platforms have become the main source of information for many people. On these platforms, propaganda, fake news, and misinformation are widely disseminated, raising serious questions about the accuracy and veracity of the data. In this paper, we will cover a review of several key approaches in the context of data veracity analysis on social media, with a particular focus on rumor detection. By exploring these diverse strategies, the purpose of this paper is to contribute to the understanding of the multifaceted techniques applied in ensuring data veracity, specifically in the challenges of rumor detection on social media platforms
